    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288660/extras/e2db19ec0c281ce6c925551917d06620.poster.avif?t=1748891545\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288660/extras/e2db19ec0c281ce6c925551917d06620.webm?t=1748891545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288660/extras/e2db19ec0c281ce6c925551917d06620.mp4?t=1748891545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a satirical humorous visual novel. The goal is to show the meaninglessness of war and radical views. Everyone is worthy of love. Make love Not War. We love you :3<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3aFurry Reich \ud83d\udc3a</h2><br>Enter the world of the <strong>Furry Reich</strong> \ud83d\udc3a and discover a touching story of love and bravery. As a furry officer in the army, you'll embark on a romantic journey with your beloved, facing the challenges and triumphs of military life and love. Don your beautiful and intricately designed uniform and immerse yourself in a world of stunning graphics and breathtaking vistas. With its heartwarming narrative, romantic themes, and gorgeous visuals, Furry Reich is an unforgettable gaming experience that will warm your heart and ignite the flames of love. Join the ranks of the furries in love and enlist today!<br><br>Furry Reich \ud83d\udc3a is a collection of stories about <strong>Furry Girls</strong> and match 3 gameplay. An exciting game consisting of a series of exciting mini-novels with fluffy girls. Relaxing gameplay and cute atmosphere. Contains mini stories about different professions with \ud83d\udc3afurry girls\ud83d\udc3a<br><br>The gameplay takes us back to the classic match-3 game (Match3), but at the heart of the game<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>- 25 levels<br></li><li>- 4 Lovely Furry Girls<br></li><li>- 3 in a row </li></ul>",
